# A game that embeds this repo as a submodule under its Source tree builds its
# UI asset catalog from these files' BYTES: HappyEditor fingerprints every .fnt it
# finds, and every generated layout carries the resulting stamp. A Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf turns the .fnt files CRLF, so a generate there
# re-stamps every layout. The game's own .gitattributes does not reach into a
# submodule, so the rule has to live here. Keep them LF.
# The blank line in each bundled font changes its Git blob so an existing
# submodule checkout rewrites the file on update. Byte-based catalogs may need
# to be regenerated once.
*.fnt text eol=lf
